+        <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">H6</span><p>AI will create more value through new capabilities than through simple time savings.</p></li>
+        <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">H7</span><p>Increasing cognitive abundance will make selection and restraint more valuable, not less.</p></li>
+        <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">H8</span><p>The best human–AI workflow will vary substantially by type of work.</p></li>
